Q: How to clear ng-select selection A: <pre><code>&lt;ng-select class=&quot;ng-select-wrap&quot;
           [searchFn]=&quot;multiTermSearch&quot;
           [items]=&quot;calculationOptions&quot;
           placeholder=&quot;Please select...&quot;
           name=&quot;calculation&quot;
           #calculationValue=&quot;ngModel&quot;
           [(ngModel)]=&quot;selectedCalculation&quot;&gt;
           [clearable]=&quot;false&quot;
&lt;/ng-select&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>use [clearable]=&quot;false&quot; besacuse by default [clearable]=&quot;true&quot; is set in ng-select</p>
